			<div class="content" id="post-content-2377990">
									

<p>In a fit of artistic madness I went and made something that might not be entirely without meaning.</p>
<p>Thanks to Zyn, Kalinin, and SoullessSinglularity for the feedback, and telling me that I had to finish it.</p>
<p><em>note, since people seem confused by my use of the less popular alternate definition: The term &quot;anartist&quot; is here used as &quot;anarchistic artist&quot; and reserved for the most misguided members of AWCY, to differentiate them from serious anomalous artists.</em></p>
<p><em>For those still having trouble reconciling this with their headcanon, I suggest comparing the term &quot;spelunker&quot;. The dictionary definition is &quot;cave explorer&quot;. Anyone using the term around an experienced</em> &quot;caver&quot; <em>will discover, as I did, that it</em> really <em>means &quot;inexperienced, destructive thrill-seekers who irreparably damage caves and endanger the experienced cavers on the rescue crews who inevitably have to save them when they drop their plastic flashlight and break their legs bumbling around in the dark.&quot;</em></p>

							</div>

								
