<blockquote>
<p>“That's what the anartist faction has never understood.”</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Had to stop reading for a few minutes after this. Partly because I initially just read it as a generic stab at anartists, and then completely left because insinuating AWCY? the only 'faction' as in 'group' of anartists.</p>
<p>Beyond that, the formatting is kinda weird, and like Decibelles said it's just&#8230; eh. Not really that gripping? You say AWCY? is dumb and not real anartists. And that's it, that's the entire point?</p>

